fabraix.com — mirrored 2026-08-23 via mirror_site.py (depth 2) + manual content-tree vendoring (site.yaml, research md/og, 5 article shells, careers/privacy/terms/security/compare pages). Site is a Vite SPA: shells carry no copy; text hydrates from /content/* at runtime, so content/ was fetched and vendored locally. Live GitHub API call (ACE repo stars) stays external. Junk: crawler regex false-positives pruned.
